                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "As far as idle games go, this is one of the more basic ones. You plant things, get coins, buy upgrades, number go up. That's the entire gameplay loop. If that's all you are looking for then the game is great. But if you are looking for something with greater complexity or strategic depth, you won't find it here. Idle games are generally simple by nature, but this one really doesn't have a whole lot going for it.",
